Ferrari Formula One 2.0b (16.10.2026)
===================================

Changes:
- Faster rendering on A500 and accelerated Amigas.
- Consistent game speed regardless of rendering speed.
- Smoother car movement on 68020 and faster Amigas with Fast memory.
- Uses Fast memory for improved performance when available.
- Uses all safe CPU caches in performance mode on 68020 and faster.

Enable performance mode with CUSTOM2=1 (PAL, SPS 0481 version).
